{"candidateAnswer":"2","evidence":"[D12:1 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?\n[D24:2 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: Hi Audrey! Pets really can make our lives better, huh? Speaking of which, I've got some awesome news -- I recently adopted another pup from a shelter. He's the best.\n[D28:6 | 9:02 am on 22 November, 2023] Andrew: No, we haven't got the chance to take them to the groomer yet. But will do that soon! So guess what, I can't help myself but to adpot another dog the other day. Here's a photo of the doggo!","itemId":"urn:uuid:68756405-aaa7-5c61-845c-98a1cd89721d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:72558b68f5d94fff37794a807f4fae97f9e40010f195ddd179d6e13f31b90b3c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many dogs does Andrew have?","referenceAnswer":"3","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"72558b68f5d94fff37794a807f4fae97f9e40010f195ddd179d6e13f31b90b3c"}}]}